OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will stay
OL,6,Fmostly dry, with occasional clear
OL,7,Fspells and light winds bringing the
OL,8,Fchance of frost and fog patches
OL,9,Fovernight, chiefly for rural parts.
OL,10,
OL,11,CWednesday:FSettled, largely dry fare
OL,12,Fwith bright and sunny spells
OL,13,Fincreasing, but early mist and fog may
OL,14,Fbe slow to burn back. Winds light.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,17,FMainly cloudy with patchy light rain
OL,18,Ffocused across the east of the area.
OL,19,FWinds light to moderate easterly.
